  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">Tests fail on origin/master: dismissing and completing an open inquiry's outcome To Do from SmartTodo and from the LegalWorkspace block is refused with the plain-words message; the chat update tool refuses before its confirm dialog.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Must-not-fire on each path: a To Do with no open inquiry completes and dismisses exactly as before (same columns written).</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">The model-driven Deactivate known limit is stated in the PR; #1984 is closed by the PR only if all three paths are covered.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Client jest suites, client-lint, tsc, build, Ai and Signals filters, full ArchTests pass; real Dataverse create+read on dev recorded; publish-size delta reported.</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>
